=== 2/5 Timestamp normalization ===
  Windows FILETIME   -> unix 1609286400  iso 2020-12-30T00:00:00Z
  Chrome / WebKit    -> unix 1655526400  iso 2022-06-18T04:26:40Z
  Unix milliseconds  -> unix 1717243500  iso 2024-06-01T12:05:00Z
  ISO-8601 string    -> unix 1717243500  iso 2024-06-01T12:05:00Z
  auto-detect (unix) -> unix 1717243500  iso 2024-06-01T12:05:00Z
